==Trivia==
* The location was first expanded with [[Changelog#v0.5.0.811_(26_Dec_2017)|patch 0.5.0.811]] on December 26, 2017.
* The location was completely reworked and expanded with [[Changelog#0.14.0.0.28333_(27_Dec_2023)|patch 0.14.0.0.28333]] on December 27, 2023.
* The health resort in-universe is called the "Azure Coast" resort, or alternatively the "Côte d’Azur" resort.
* This location is based on the abandoned sanatorium "Strelna" which is located near St. Petersburg.
